+ * (edp_receiver_ready_T7(),
+ * drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/dc/link/protocols/link_edp_panel_control.c:480)
+ * and back to 0 when it stops (_T9(), :455). sun60i_dp_train_verify() therefore
+ * requires the other three and this requires all four.
+ *
